Subject: Load the configured domain-aware feature stream in PHOENIX training

The PHOENIX training loader aliases both streams to features_path. Other dataset
loaders and PHOENIX evaluation use features_path_retrain for the adapted stream.
Honor that existing argument without changing feature mixing or optimization.

--- a/CiCo/CLCL/dataloaders/dataloader_ph_retrieval_train.py
+++ b/CiCo/CLCL/dataloaders/dataloader_ph_retrieval_train.py
@@ -82,7 +82,7 @@
         for sentance_id in sentance_ids:
 
             video_path=os.path.join(self.features_path,captions[sentance_id]['video_name']+'.pkl')
-            video_path_retrain=os.path.join(self.features_path,captions[sentance_id]['video_name']+'.pkl')
+            video_path_retrain=os.path.join(self.features_path_retrain,captions[sentance_id]['video_name']+'.pkl')
 
             if sentance_id not in self.video_dict:
                 self.video_dict[sentance_id]=[video_path]
